{"turn_id": "d09-t1", "session_id": "d09", "turn": 1, "answer": {"claims": [{"key": "feature_categories", "text": "该论文探索三类特征来检测激进内容：文本特征、心理特征和行为特征。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1905.08067", "chunk_id": "c-d156d90baa1521acbf5ee43c"}]}, {"key": "behavioural_category", "text": "行为特征类别旨在捕捉与用户及其行为相关的不同属性。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1905.08067", "chunk_id": "c-d5f2499401c5351f97c00c60"}]}, {"key": "activity_followers", "text": "行为特征包括用户活跃程度（发推频率）以及关注者/被关注者比例（followers/following ratio）。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1905.08067", "chunk_id": "c-d5f2499401c5351f97c00c60"}]}, {"key": "mention_graph", "text": "作者通过mention动作构建mention交互图，其中用户为用户节点，若用户A提及用户B则在两节点间存在一条有向边。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1905.08067", "chunk_id": "c-d5f2499401c5351f97c00c60"}]}, {"key": "centrality", "text": "行为特征使用不同的中心性度量来衡量用户在社交网络中的影响力，例如degree centrality、betweenness centrality和HITS-Hub。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1905.08067", "chunk_id": "c-d5f2499401c5351f97c00c60"}]}, {"key": "mentions_hits_top", "text": "在重要特征中，与单个用户提及次数及其在交互网络中的HITS hub和authority排名相关的行为特征位居前茅。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1905.08067", "chunk_id": "c-b09cb3e1017bca35035ac294"}]}, {"key": "behavioural_interpretation", "text": "这些行为特征反映了用户与他人互动的活跃程度及其从社区获得的关注度，这与激进用户传播意识形态和接触潜在同类的目标相关。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1905.08067", "chunk_id": "c-b09cb3e1017bca35035ac294"}]}, {"key": "behavioral_distinctive", "text": "结果表明，激进用户确实表现出可区分的文本、心理和行为属性。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1905.08067", "chunk_id": "c-0996ce97ab0b0073667dab34"}]}], "decision": "answer"}, "error": null, "trace_id": "d09-t1", "assessment": {"execution_success": true, "task_success": null, "pipeline_success": null, "behavior_match": true, "schema_valid": true, "stage_flow_valid": true, "citation_structure_valid": true, "memory_committed": true, "nlu_correct": false, "reflect_correct": null, "retrieval_effective": true, "generate_valid": true, "degraded": false}}
{"turn_id": "d09-t2", "session_id": "d09", "turn": 2, "answer": {"claims": [{"key": "three_feature_categories", "text": "论文探索三类信息特征来检测激进内容：1) 激进语言（文本特征）；2) 心理信号（心理特征）；3) 行为特征，其中一些是基于用户的，另一些是基于消息的。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1905.08067", "chunk_id": "c-d156d90baa1521acbf5ee43c"}]}, {"key": "behavioural_features", "text": "行为特征用于捕捉与用户及其行为相关的属性，包括用户活跃程度（发推频率）以及关注者/被关注者比例（followers/following ratio）。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1905.08067", "chunk_id": "c-d5f2499401c5351f97c00c60"}]}, {"key": "mention_graph", "text": "论文利用 hashtag 和 mention 动作的特征捕捉用户互动，并构建 mention 交互图，该图为有向图，当用户 i 提及用户 j 时，两节点间存在边。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1905.08067", "chunk_id": "c-d5f2499401c5351f97c00c60"}]}, {"key": "centrality_measures", "text": "构建 mention 图后，论文使用不同的中心性度量来衡量每个用户对其网络的影响力，例如 degree centrality、betweenness centrality 和 HITS-Hub。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1905.08067", "chunk_id": "c-d5f2499401c5351f97c00c60"}]}, {"key": "top_behavioural_features", "text": "在最重要的特征中，与单个用户提及次数以及其在交互网络中的 HITS hub 和 authority 排名相关的行为特征位居前茅。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1905.08067", "chunk_id": "c-b09cb3e1017bca35035ac294"}]}, {"key": "behavioural_interpretation", "text": "论文将这些行为特征与用户与他人互动的活跃程度以及其从社区获得关注的程度联系起来，并关联到激进用户传播意识形态和接触潜在同类者的目标。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1905.08067", "chunk_id": "c-b09cb3e1017bca35035ac294"}]}, {"key": "feature_importance_method", "text": "论文使用随机森林的 mean decrease impurity 方法来确定每个特征类别中最重要的特征。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1905.08067", "chunk_id": "c-b09cb3e1017bca35035ac294"}]}, {"key": "psychological_top_feature", "text": "用于区分激进推文的最重要特征是心理特征距离度量，其次是 Us-them 二分法（统计 I、they、we、you 等代词的总数）。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1905.08067", "chunk_id": "c-b09cb3e1017bca35035ac294"}]}, {"key": "overall_signal_claim", "text": "论文报告激进用户确实表现出可区分的文本、心理和行为属性，并称心理属性是最具区分度的特征之一。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1905.08067", "chunk_id": "c-0996ce97ab0b0073667dab34"}]}], "decision": "answer"}, "error": null, "trace_id": "d09-t2", "assessment": {"execution_success": true, "task_success": null, "pipeline_success": null, "behavior_match": true, "schema_valid": true, "stage_flow_valid": true, "citation_structure_valid": true, "memory_committed": true, "nlu_correct": true, "reflect_correct": null, "retrieval_effective": true, "generate_valid": true, "degraded": false}}
